  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1490",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-21T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T12:03:27.046Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालको पश्चिमी क्षेत्रमा पश्चिमी वायूको तथा पुर्वी क्षेत्रमा भारतको ओडिसा आसपास अवस्थित न्युन चापीय क्षेत्रको आंशिक प्रभाव  रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, western Nepal is under the partial influence of westerly winds, while eastern Nepal is under the partial influence of a low-pressure area located around Odisha, India.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली क्षेत्रका साथै मधेश प्रदेश र कोशी प्रदेशको तराई क्षेत्रमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका साथै मधेश प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy in the Himalayan region of the country, as well as in Madhesh Province and the Terai region of Koshi Province. Mist/fog is likely at a few places in the Terai regions, valleys and river basins during the early morning. There is a possibility of light rain accompanied by thunder and lightning at one or two places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and Madhesh Province.",
    "tomorrow_np": "मधेश प्रदेश र कोशी प्रदेश लगायत गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली क्षेत्रमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । बाँकी क्षेत्रमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका साथै मधेश प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy in Madhesh and Koshi Provinces, as well as in the Himalayan region of Gandaki Province, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas. There is a possibility of light rain accompanied by thunder and lightning at one or two places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and Madhesh Province.",
    "special": ""
  },
